description	"Jaina Solo

The Sword of the Jedi and veteran Rogue Squadron pilot, equipped with her flight suit, heavy blaster, purple saber, and field repair tools.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- 10% Faster RoF
- Pilot DL-44 Pistol (2)
-- 35%- RoF
-- 40%+ Damage/FP Drain
-- 20%+ Velocity
- Welder (1)
- Concussion Grenade (1)
- Lightsaber (Cyan,Yellow/Red)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (2)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Staggers On Hit
-- Saber Throw (1) ^3[CS1]

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (2)
- Mindtrick (1)

^8Attributes:
- Rally
- Blast Armor
- Tracking Beacon
- 15% Faster Hacking 
- Force Focus (1)
- Force Block (2)
- Healing Capped at 35

^8Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Deploy Forcefield ^3[CS4]
- Bacta Injection ^3[CS3]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]"